arxiv-2111-03194.description:
A 2021 arXiv research paper by Colin M. Weller and Gerald A. Miller. Three current models of QCD in (1+1) dimensions are examined and extended in light-front coordinates. A pion of high momentum is found to have an infinite extent along its direction of motion. There has been a recent revival of interest in theories involving two-dimensional(one-space-one time) treatments of QCD
